Value SLOT (\d+(?:\([^\)]+\))?)
Value TOTAL_MEMORY (\d+)
Value RESERVED_MEMORY (\d+)
Value AVAILABLE_MEMORY (\d+)
Value USED_MEMORY (\d+)
Value USAGE_PCT (\d+)

Start
  ^Slot\s+${SLOT}
  ^Total\s+Memory\s+:\s+${TOTAL_MEMORY}\s+KB
  ^Reserved\s+Memory\s+:\s+${RESERVED_MEMORY}\s+KB
  ^Available\s+Memory\s+:\s+${AVAILABLE_MEMORY}\s+KB
  ^Total\s+Used\s+Memory\s+:\s+${USED_MEMORY}\s+KB
  ^Usage\s+:\s+${USAGE_PCT}% -> Record
